[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_03_0010","text":"诶嘿嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_03_0020","text":"哈哈，看来小糸很喜欢，真是太好了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_03_0030","text":"服装做得很好呢。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_03_0040","text":"是、是的……！\n非常……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_03_0050","text":"设、设计可爱是一方面，\n但不仅如此……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_03_0060","text":"果、果然\n是我们的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_03_0070","text":"只属于我们四个人的服装……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_03_0080","text":"……是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_03_0090","text":"穿上它，一起呈现精彩的舞台吧。\n以noctchill四个人一起。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_03_0100","text":"……！\n是的……！"}]
